  "image": "Drunkard.png",
  "onSuccess": "You got em? Dude, bro, you are a life saver, I was getting fuckin' depressed about this shit and everything. Check out the front room I have a bunch of clothes laid out for you, take em, for free, they're yours. Come on back for some work soon, I have a bunch of shit I gotta get done, and I'll pay well.",
